1 OCCU Hereditary Princess of Hanover, Princess Consort of Hanover, Electoral Princess Consort of Hanover, Sophie Dorothea Herzogin von Braunschweig-Lüneburg, ﻉ/  (Anne-oo-ik), Mother, Kurprinzessin von Hannover (1682 - 1694), Duchess Of
2 CONC  Brunswick-Luneburg
