1 NAME William Henry /Hanover/
1 NAME 1st Duke of /Gloucester/
1 NAME Prince William Henry, Duke of Gloucester and Edinburgh
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 25 NOV 1743
2 PLAC London, England - St. Anne
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 NOV 1743
