1 NOTE As high admiral, Charles defeated a Russian fleet in the Gulf of Finland 
2 CONT in 1788. He was regent from 1792 to 1796 during the minority of King 
2 CONT Gustav IV Adolph and again in 1809 after Gustav had lost his throne 
2 CONT through revolution. During Charles's reign Sweden lost Finland to Russia 
2 CONT in 1809 but was united with Norway in 1814.
