2 TITL St. George’s Chapel, located at Windsor Castle
2 NOTE George III, King of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland is your 12th cousin four times removed.
3 CONT You 
3 CONT    →  Raymond Henry Ashworth, Sr. 
3 CONT your father →  Susie Gertrude Ashworth (Smith) 
3 CONT his mother →  Nathaniel E. Smith 
3 CONT her father →  Nathaniel M. Smith 
3 CONT his father →  Jonathan Smith 
3 CONT his father →  Deacon Aaron Smith 
3 CONT his father →  Abigail Nash (Kellogg) 
3 CONT his mother →  Lt. Joseph Kellogg 
3 CONT her father →  Martin Kellogg 
3 CONT his father → Phillippe Kellogg 
3 CONT his father →  Sir Thomas Nicholas Kellogg, of Debden 
3 CONT his father →  Nicholas Kellogg, II 
3 CONT his father →  Alice Hadley (Audley) 
3 CONT his mother → Sir Humphrey Audley, Kt. 
3 CONT her father →  Eleanor Tuchet (Holland) 
3 CONT his mother →  Edmund Holland, 4th Earl of Kent 
3 CONT her father → Margaret Holland, Duchess of Clarence 
3 CONT his sister →  Joan Beaufort, Queen of Scots 
3 CONT her daughter →  Sir John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl 
3 CONT her son → Elizabeth Stewart 
3 CONT his daughter →  Matthew Stuart, 13th Earl of Lennox 
3 CONT her son →  Henry Stewart, Lord Darnley 
3 CONT his son → James VI King of Scots, James I King of England & Ireland 
3 CONT his son →  Elizabeth of Bohemia 
3 CONT his daughter →  Sophia of Hanover 
3 CONT her daughter → George I, King of Great Britain and Ireland 
3 CONT her son →  George II, King of Great Britain and Ireland 
3 CONT his son →  Frederick, Prince of Wales 
3 CONT his son → George III, King of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland 
