1 NOTE Reign: 1837-51: One of Queen Victoria's wicked uncles. He lost an eye at the battle of Tournai in 1774. He was involved in several unsavoury scandals including the mysterious murder of his valet Sellis and an alleged incestuous re
2 CONC lationship with his sister Princess Sophia, resulting in the birth of a child. He remained a bachelor until 44 when he married his 1st cousin, 37 year old Princess Frederica of Mecklenburg-Strelitz. The Princess had already been m
2 CONC arried twice and had the reputation of being loose.
