2 CONT *'''King of Sweden:''' Reign 29. March 1792 – 29. March 1809 Coronation 3. April 1800
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/4107259 Gustav III] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/310876642120006420 Charles XIII]
2 CONT *'''Wikipedia:''' [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_IV_Adolf_of_Sweden English ]  [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_IV_Adolf Svenska]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Succeeded his father as king at the age of 13.  Married at 18.  Violent and obstinate in his reign and alienated his country's most faithful supporters.  By 1809 it was obvious that he was insane, and after being dethroned, he and
2 CONC  his whole family were transported to Germany.  A few months later his marriage ended in divorce, and he settled in Switzerland.  After his death, his body was returned to Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT One report shows him serving under Napoleon and being a lieutenant in the Prussian army.
