1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Catharina of Württemberg
2 CONT *Princess Catharina Frederica of Württemberg (February 21, 1783 - November 29, 1835) was the second wife of Jerome Bonaparte.
2 CONT *Catharina was born in Saint Petersburg, Russia to the later King Frederick I of Württemberg and Duchess Augusta of Brunswick-Wolfenbüttel.
2 CONT *She was Jerome Bonaparte's second wife, married on August 22, 1807 in the Royal Palace at Fontainebleau, France. She was queen consort of the Kingdom of Westphalia. When the kingdom was dissolved after the downfall of the Napoleo
2 CONC nic Empire she followed her husband into exile.
2 CONT *Catharina died in Lausanne, Switzerland.
2 CONT
