2 CONT
2 CONT "George Augustus Frederick FitzClarence, 1st Earl of Munster PC (29 January 1794 – 20 March 1842), was the eldest natural son of William IV of the United Kingdom and his long-time mistress Dorothy Jordan. Like his siblings, he had
2 CONC  little contact with his mother after his parents separated in 1811, preferring to rely on his expectations from his father. He served as an army officer during the Peninsular War and subsequently in India. His father, though prou
2 CONC d of his military record, was deeply concerned about his drinking and gambling, vices to which many of William's brothers were prone."
2 CONT
2 CONT ============================================================
