2 NOTE Queen Victoria (Alexandrina Victoria);
3 CONT
3 CONT Born 24 May 1819, Died 22 January 1901.  She was from 20 June 1837 the Queen of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland and from 1 May 1876 the first Empress of India until her death. Her reign as Queen lasted 63 years and
3 CONC  seven months, longer than that of any other British monarch to date. The period centred on her reign is known as the Victorian era.
