1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HON. ELIZABETH DIANA BOSVILLE MACDONALD===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death and Burial===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hon. Elizabeth Diana Bosville MacDonald died on 9 June 1839, at Edinburgh in Midlothian, Scotland. Her body was deposited in the vault below St. John's Chapel in Edinburgh before it was transported to Dingwall in Ross and Croma
2 CONC rty, where it was interred in the Davidson family vault. Her burial records reads as follows: "The Honble. Mrs Elizabeth Diana Bosville Davidson wife of Duncan Davidson Esq. of Tulloch, born 27th Febry 1804, died at Edinburgh 9th 
2 CONC June 1839, and interred in the Family Vault at Dingwall the 7th November 1839. The body was deposited in a vault under St John's Chapel Edinburgh during the intervening period between the death and the interment". [National Record
2 CONC s of Scotland, Dingwall Deaths, 1820-52, reference OPR.62/2] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000164906232938 Image of Burial Record]'''
