1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p10413.htm#i104122 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[https://geneall.net/de/name/9824/konstantin-grossfuerst-von-russland/ Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.hansdenyngre.dk/hans_uk/wizg17.htm#825 Johann the Younger # 807]
