2 CONT Lucius William Charles Frederick Cary, Master of Falkland was born on 24 November 1831.2 He was the son of Lucius Bentinck Cary, 10th Viscount of Falkland and Lady Amelia Fitz-Clarence.1 He married Sarah Christiana Keighly, daught
2 CONC er of Major Henry Peach Keighly, on 11 May 1858.2 He died on 6 August 1871 at age 39, without issue.1 He was styled as Master of Falkland.1 He held the office of Deputy Lieutenant (D.L.) of the West Riding, Yorkshire.2
2 CONT Citations
