2 TITL Princess Mary of Teck
2 NOTE Mary of Teck (Victoria Mary Augusta Louise Olga Pauline Claudine Agnes; 
3 CONT Was born on 26 May 1867 – 24 March 1953. She was the queen-empress consort of George V of the United Kingdom and the British Dominions, Emperor of India. Before her husband's accession, she was successively Duchess of York, Duches
3 CONC s of Cornwall and Princess of Wales. By birth, she was a princess of Teck, in the Kingdom of Württemberg, with the style Her Serene Highness. To her family, she was informally known as May, after her birth month.
3 CONT
3 CONT
