1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>John Alexander, sixth Earl of Hopetoun</strong>, born 22 March 1831, served in the Army, and was Lord-Lieutenant of the county of Linlithgow. Died 2 April 1873. Married, 8 January 1860, Etheldred Anne, eldest daughter of 
2 CONC C. T. S. Birch Reynardson of Holywell Hall, co. Lincoln. She died 15 October 1884, leaving issue : 
2 CONT * John Adrian Louis, seventh Earl of Hopetoun. 
2 CONT * Charles Archibald, born 12 May 1863, died 2 April 1888. 
2 CONT * Estella Mary, born 1866. 
2 CONT * Dorothea Louisa, born 1868."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/504/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. IV, page 504
