1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Christian Frederik Vilhelm Carl  zu Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Glücksburg, Prince(Prins) af Danmark.
2 CONT *King(konge) Frederik VIII of Denmark 29 January 1906 - 14 may 1912
2 CONT *Valgsprog: Herren er min hjælper
2 CONT *Motto: The Lord is my helper
2 CONT
