2 CONT Portal icon	Denmark portal Portal icon	Greece portal Portal icon	Biography portal Campbell, John; Sherrard, Philip (1968). Modern Greece. London: Ernest Benn. Christmas, Walter (1914). King George of Greece. Translated by A. G. Ch
2 CONC ater. New York: McBride, Nast & Company. Clogg, Richard (1979). A Short History of Modern Greece. Cambridge University Press. Forster, Edward S. (1958). A Short History of Modern Greece 1821–1956 3rd edition. London: Methuen and C
2 CONC o. Van der Kiste, John (1994). Kings of the Hellenes. Stroud, Gloucestershire: Sutton Publishing. ISBN 0-7509-0525-5. Woodhouse, C. M. (1968). The Story of Modern Greece. London: Faber and Faber. External links[edit] 	Wikimedia Co
