1 OCCU marraine de maman 1924-1928, София Фредерика Дагмар Шлезвиг-Холщайин-Зондербург-Глюксбург (Датска), Empress of Imperial Russia, Empress of Russia, keiriinna, Empress consort of Russia, keisriinna
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Name/title:''' Marie Sophie Fredrica Dagmar Princess(prinsesse) of Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Glücksburg.
2 CONT *'''By Marriage:''' Marie Feodorovna Romanov 1866.
2 CONT *'''Empress consort of All the Russias:''' Tenure 13. March 1881 – 1 November 1894 Coronation 27. May 1883
