2 CONT *Charles Michael, Duke of Mecklenburg (German: Carl Michael Herzog zu Mecklenburg; 17 June [O.S. 5 June] 1863  – 6 December 1934) was an officer in the Imperial Russian Army, heir presumptive to the throne of Mecklenburg-Strelitz 
2 CONC and from 1918 head of the Grand Ducal House.
2 CONT *Died unmarried and without issues.
