2 CONT
2 CONT Based on currently available historical evidence, there is no documentation supporting a personal relationship—romantic or otherwise—between Behse and Alexander II. Her marriage to Engbertus Jansen is well attested in records, and
2 CONC  no archival sources link her to the Russian imperial family. Claims circulating in folklore or on user‑generated platforms such as MyHeritage are not considered reliable without primary documentation.
2 CONT
