2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Gräfin von Taubenheim was born on 31 July 1843 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany. She was the daughter of Wilhelm Graf von Taubenheim and Marie Gräfin von Württemberg. She died on 11 April 1919 at age 75.
