2 CONT      Olga Gräfin von Taubenheim was born on 15 September 1850 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany. She was the daughter of Wilhelm Graf von Taubenheim and Marie Gräfin von Württemberg. She married August Baron von Wollwert-La
2 CONC uterburg on 17 September 1872. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 16 May 1925 at age 74 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became von Wollwert-Lauterburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Olga Gräfin von Taubenheim and August Baron von Wollwert-Lauterburg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Olga Baronin von Wollwert-Lauterburg b. 4 Feb 1874, d. 6 Apr 1894
2 CONT
2 CONT Source / Forrás:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p4782.htm#i47813
