2 CONT F, #47816, b. 25 October 1852, d. 19 March 1936
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=1 Sep 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sophie Gräfin von Taubenheim was born on 25 October 1852 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany. She was the daughter of Wilhelm Graf von Taubenheim and Marie Gräfin von Württemberg. She married Ernst Baier von Ehrenburg on
2 CONC  22 September 1883. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 19 March 1936 at age 83.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became von Ehrenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sophie Gräfin von Taubenheim and Ernst Baier von Ehrenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Wilma Baier von Ehrenburg b. 5 Oct 1884, d. 2 Sep 1938
2 CONT
