2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Agnes Mary Catherine Noel (9 October 1877 - 1 March 1915). She died unmarried and without issue. He married, secondly, Mary Elizabeth Dease (d. 17 November 1937) on 2 Feb 1880. They had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Norah Ida Emily Noel (4 January 1881 - 23 May 1939). She married Robert Charles Graf Bentinck (London, 5 December 1875 - 12 March 1932) on 8 September 1915. They had two children: Brydgytte Blanche Bentinck (11 November 1916 
2 CONC - 5 September 2010). She married Jonkheer Adrian Hendrik Sibble van der Wyck (The Hague, 22 June 1906 - 4 November 1973) on 2 February 1937 in London. They had five children: Caroline Norah Frederique Adrienne van der Wyck (b. 1 J
2 CONC un 1938). She married Baron K. J. A. Collet d'Escury in May 1961. They had four children: Baron Guyon Adolf André Collet d'Escury (b. 25 Apr 1962) Baroness Juliette Brydgytte Blanche Collet d'Escury (b. 17 Aug 1963) Baroness Marin
2 CONC a Caroline Norah Collet d'Escury (b. 30 Mar 1965) Baron Robert Willem Frederick Collet d'Escury (b. 1970) Brydgytte Agnes Dawn van der Wyck (b. 6 June 1940). She married Paul Heinz Maria Dirk Vermeer (b. 10 July 1935) on 2 March 1
2 CONC 968. They were divorced after having three children: Robert Paul Adriaan Henry Simon Vermeer (b. 14 October 1968) Fiona Victoria Regina Brydgytte Vermeer (b. 24 Mar 1970) Nadia Nora Noel Vermeer (b. 1971) Reina Jeanne Woltera van 
2 CONC der Wyck (b. 2 Dec 1942). She married Hendrik Willem van Harreveld (b. 1939) on 21 September 1973. They had three children: Hugo Johannes Hendrik van Harreveld (b. 1974) Wendela Blanche Catherine van Harreveld (b. 1977) Diederik G
2 CONC odard Adriaan Roelant van Harreveld (b. 1980) Evert Rein Robert Henry van der Wyck (b. 12 August 1945) Douglas Roderick Arthur Duncan van der Wyck (b. 9 Aug 1955) Henry Noel Bentinck, 11th Earl of Portland Lady Clare Mary Charlott
2 CONC e Noel (1882 - 11 March 1962). She married Charles Mervyn King (d. 25 January 1965) on 2 October 1902. They had one daughter. Agnes Celestria Mary King (1917 - 1946). She married Charles Guy Vaughan-Lee R.N. Arthur Edward Joseph N
2 CONC oel, who succeeded his father as the 4th Earl of Gainsborough Charles Hubert Francis Noel (1885 - 1947) Capt. OBE. He married May Dick, dau. of Brig. Gen. Archibald Campbell Douglas Dick CB CMG, of Pitkerro, co. Angus, and had iss
