2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT Before Diana married into the British royal family, she had her own royal connections via her ancestors; illegitimate offspring of Kings Charles II and James II had joined the aristocratic Spencer line. Thanks to her lineage, Dian
2 CONC a actually had more English royal blood than Prince Charles, as the Windsors have strong Germanic ties. Charles' great-grandfather, King George V, changed the family name from Saxe-Coburg-Gotha to Windsor in 1917, due to tensions 
2 CONC with Germany during World War I. https://www.interestingfacts.com/princess-diana-facts/Yw1oE0KJ8wAItdv5
