2 CONT *Princess Beatrice of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha''' (Beatrice Leopoldine Victoria; 20 April 1884–13 July 1966), She was called Bea by her family.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Beatrice Leopoldine Victoria Saxe-Coburg and Gotha, Princess of the United Kingdom was a member of the British Royal Family, a granddaughter of Queen Victoria. 
2 CONT *Married into the Spanish Royal Family, and was the wife of Alfonso de Orleans y Borbón, Infante of Spain. 
2 CONT
