1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Lord Leopold Arthur Louis Mountbatten, GCVO
2 CONT *Unmarried and without issues
2 CONT
2 CONT == Royal house ==
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Battenberg House of Battenberg] (Cadet branch of the House of Hesse-Darmstadt)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p10068.htm#i100675 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/U/per_page.php?id=384651 Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.hansdenyngre.dk/hans_uk/wizg40.htm#3864 Johann the Younger #1972]
