1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Royal house ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Wettin House of Wettin]
2 CONT
2 CONT = Titles and styles =
2 CONT
2 CONT Royal styles of King Edward VIII of the United Kingdom 
