2 CONT
2 CONT Born into the [http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Wettin House of Wettin]
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT "Prince Henry, Duke of Gloucester (Henry William Frederick Albert; 31 March 1900 – 10 June 1974) was a soldier and member of the British Royal Family, the third son of King George V of the United Kingdom and Queen Mary.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was appointed potential regent for his niece, when his brother (George VI) came to the throne in 1936, and was required to stay in the United Kingdom until she came of age in case her father died and she ascended the throne as 
2 CONC a minor.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Duke served as a soldier for most of his life. He was also the 11th Governor-General of Australia, from 1945 to 1947. At his death, he was the last surviving knight of the Order of St. Patrick. Also at the time of his death in
2 CONC  1974, he was the last surviving child of King George V and Queen Mary."
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================================================================
