1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Francis Hugh Cambridge, 2nd Marquess of Cambridge, GCVO (11 October 1895 – 16 April 1981), known as Prince George of Teck until 1917 and as Earl of Eltham from 1917 to 1927, was a descendant of the British R
2 CONC oyal Family. He was the elder son of the 1st Marquess of Cambridge, formerly the Duke of Teck, and his wife, the former Lady Margaret Grosvenor. He was a nephew of Queen Mary, the consort of King George V, and of the 1st Earl of A
2 CONC thlone.
