1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hon. Denys Scott''' 
2 CONT * Born on 1 June 1877.
2 CONT * Son of John Scott, 3rd Earl of Eldon and Henrietta Minna Turnor.
2 CONT * Married Lillias Amy Stuart, daughter of Commander Dudley Charles Stuart and Amy Clara Page, on 19 June 1907.
2 CONT * Died in 1962.
2 CONT * Educated at Winchester College, Winchester, Hampshire, England.
2 CONT * Fought in the Boer War.
2 CONT * Captain in the service of the Royal Artillery (Territorial Army).
2 CONT * Fought in the First World War.
2 CONT * Captain in the service of the Royal Tank Corps.
2 CONT * Lived at The Holt, Appledore, Devon, England. '''Children of Hon. Denys Scott and Lillias Amy Stuart'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * S/Ldr. John Ernest Dudley Scott b. 10 May 1908, d. 23 Apr 2002
2 CONT * Frederick Denys Scott b. 2 Dec 1909, d. 1996
2 CONT * Eustace Ian Scott b. 18 Apr 1911, d. 14 Apr 1996
2 CONT * Sybil Maud Scott b. 26 Apr 1914, d. 4 Aug 1919
2 CONT * Anthony James Scott b. 18 Jan 1921, d. Oct 1940<br/>
2 CONT [http://thepeerage.com/p4325.htm#i43244 The Peerage]
2 CONT ----
