1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hon. Michael Scott''' 
2 CONT * Born on 31 August 1878.
2 CONT * Son of John Scott, 3rd Earl of Eldon and Henrietta Minna Turnor.
2 CONT * Married, '''firstly''', Cecilia Bruton, daughter of William Bruton, on 6 March 1907. He and Cecilia Bruton were divorced in 1919.
2 CONT * Married, '''secondly''', Marie Madeline Martinella on 8 June 1940.
2 CONT * Married, '''thirdly''', Dorothie Primrose Murray-Stewart, daughter of Major C. Murray-Stewart, on 12 August 1958.
2 CONT * Died on 9 January 1959 at age 80.
2 CONT * Educated at Winchester College, Winchester, Hampshire, England.
2 CONT * Fought in the First World War.
2 CONT * Invested as a Officer, Order of the British Empire (O.B.E.) in 1918.
2 CONT * Decorated with the award of the Order of Aviz of Portugal.
2 CONT * Decorated with the award of the Order of the Black Star of France. '''Child of Hon. Michael Scott and Cecilia Bruton'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Heather Alice Cecily Scott b. 16 Jun 1908, d. c 1965<br/>
2 CONT [http://thepeerage.com/p4325.htm#i43246 The Peerage]
2 CONT ----
