2 CONT
2 CONT Chevalier. The following is among the Decorations and medals awarded by the Allied Powers at various fates to the British Forces for distinguished services rendered during the course of the campaign. His Majesty the King has given
2 CONC  unrestricted permission in all cases to wear the decorations and medals in question. Decorations conferred by The President of the Portuguese Republic.
