1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hon. Osmund Scott''' 
2 CONT * Born on 24 March 1876.
2 CONT * Son of John Scott, 3rd Earl of Eldon and Henrietta Minna Turnor.1,
2 CONT * Married Mary Cecilia Stuart, daughter of Commander Dudley Charles Stuart and Amy Clara Page, on 12 September 1906.
2 CONT * Died on 9 September 1948 at age 72.
2 CONT * Educated at Winchester College, Winchester, Hampshire, England.
2 CONT * Fought in the First World War between 1916 and 1918, with the Royal Army Service Corps. '''Children of Hon. Osmund Scott and Mary Cecilia Stuart'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lt.-Col. Harold Eldon Scott b. 4 Sep 1907
2 CONT * Osmund Stuart Scott b. 14 May 1909, d. 1985
2 CONT * Alan Dudley Scott b. 26 Sep 1910, d. 29 Apr 1951
2 CONT * Lt.-Col. Eric Surtees Scott b. 20 May 1912
2 CONT * Major Kenneth Bertram Scott b. 17 Aug 1915, d. 9 Aug 1943
2 CONT * Margaret Mary Scott b. 30 Sep 1919, d. 4 Sep 1920
2 CONT * Rachel Amy Scott b. 20 Aug 1921, d. 14 Sep 1923 [http://thepeerage.com/p4325.htm#i43242 The Peerage]
