1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reuss ältere Linie 1902-1918. Graf und Herr von Plauen, Herr zu Greiz, Kranichfeld, Gera, Schleiz und Lobenstein. LINIE ERLOSCHEN.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Reuss ältere Linie 1902-1918. Graf und Herr von Plauen, Herr zu Greiz, Kranichfeld, Gera, Schleiz, und Lobenstein. Folgt seinem vater am 19. April 1902 als Fürst. Regierungunfärig wird Fürst Heinrich XlV Reuss jüngere Linie. Füstr
2 CONC egent von Reuss ältere Linie 1902-1908, diesem folgt Heinrich XXVll Reuss jüngere Linie 1908 als Prinzregent und seit 1913 als Fürstregent von Reuss ältere Linie. Dank am 11. November 1918 ab
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Heinrich XXlV was the lasst reigning Prince Reuß of Greiz from 1902 to 1918. Then he became head of the House Reuß of Greiz., which became extinct at his death in 1927. Because of a physical and mental disability, due to an accide
2 CONC nt in his childhood, Henrich XXlV retained the regency from 1902 until 1913 with Heinrich XlV, Prince Reuß Younger Line and at his death the regency continued with Heinrich XXVll until the abolition of the German monachies in 1918
2 CONC . At his death in 1927, The House Reuß of Greiz became extinct, Heinrich XXlV died unmarried and with no issue, the titel passed to Heinrich XXVll of Reuß Younger Line.
