1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Haakon VII of Norway=
2 CONT '''Haakon VII''', born '''Christian Frederik Carl Georg Valdemar Axel''', known as '''Prince Carl of Denmark''' until 1905, was a Danish prince who became the first king of Norway after the 1905 dissolution of the union with Swede
2 CONC n. He reigned from November 1905 until his death in September 1957. Continue reading: [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haakon_VII_of_Norway Wikipedia]
2 CONT
