2 CONT Nicholas II was the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-III-Romanov-Tsar-of-Russia/6000000003245207225?through=6000000000703639356 Alexander III Romanov, Tsar of Russia] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Mariya-Feodorovna-R
2 CONC omanov/6000000001545622454?through=6000000003245207225 Mariya Feodorovna Romanov]
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas II - '''Emperor and Autocrat of All the Russias:''' Reigned from 1 November (Old Style 20 October) 1894 - till abdication on 15 March 1917. Coronation date: 26 May (Old Style 14 May) 1896.
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-III-Romanov-Tsar-of-Russia/6000000003245207225 Alexander III] '''Successor:'''	Monarchy abolished
2 CONT
