3 CONT I was able to translate the majority of text. But something got lost in translation. In what language you write? Interesting story. If you can translate into English, was better understood. The problem is that the automatic transl
3 CONC ator has a rudimentary language. On my computer gave Finnish, Russian and Belarusian. Some parts of the text were not translated. The secret is to use a basic writing ... :)
