1 NAME Hans Ludwig David Carl Maximilian Ernst Peter * /Yorck von Wartenburg/
2 GIVN Hans Ludwig David Carl Maximilian Ernst Peter *
2 _MARNM Yorck von Wartenburg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 NOV 1904
2 PLAC Schloss Klein-Oels
2 ADDR
3 CITY Oelsnitz | Oleśnica
3 STAE Lower Silesian Voivodeship
3 CTRY Germany now Poland
