2 CONT Siegfried von Waldenburg (30 December 1898 – 27 March 1973) was a highly decorated Generalmajor in the Wehrmacht during World War II. He was also a recipient of the Knight's Cross of the Iron Cross. The Knight's Cross of the Iron 
2 CONC Cross was awarded to recognise extreme battlefield bravery or successful military leadership.
