1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Edward Charles Fitz-Clarence, 6th Earl of Munster''' 
2 CONT * Born on 3 October 1899.
2 CONT * Son of Brig.-Gen. Charles Fitz-Clarence, V.C. and Violet Spencer-Churchill.
2 CONT * Married, '''firstly''', Monica Sheila Harrington Grayson, daughter of Lt.-Col. Sir Henry Mulleneux Grayson, 1st Bt. and Dora Beatrice Harrington, on 30 July 1925. He and Monica Sheila Harrington Grayson were divorced in 1930.
2 CONT * Married, '''secondly,''' Vivian Scholfield, daughter of Benjamin Scholfield, on 28 September 1939.
2 CONT * Died in 1983.
2 CONT * Educated at Eton College, Windsor, Berkshire, and at Royal Military College, Sandhurst, Berkshire
2 CONT * Gained the rank of Captain in the service of the Irish Guards.
2 CONT * Succeeded to the title of 6th Viscount Fitz-Clarence [U.K., 1831] on 27 August 1975, to the title of 6th Earl of Munster [U.K., 1831] on 27 August 1975., and to the title of 7th Baron Tewkesbury, co. Gloucester [U.K., 1831] on 2
2 CONC 7 August 1975.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Edward Charles Fitz-Clarence, 6th Earl of Munster and Monica Sheila Harrington Grayson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anthony Charles Fitz-Clarence, 7th Earl of Munster b. 21 Mar 1926, d. 30 Dec 2000
2 CONT * Lady Jill Mary Fitz-Clarence1 b. 6 Feb 1928<br/>
