2 CONT '''From [https://www.freebmd.org.uk/cgi/information.pl?cite=Ei6mKWvjMCwhBkzYp6jbog&scan=1 FreeBMD: Registration of marriage of William Molyneux Clarke in 1909] and [https://www.freebmd.org.uk/cgi/information.pl?cite=odQBMJh%2FkJCs
