2 CONT Victoria Alice Elizabeth Julia Marie Princess of Battenberg, HSH Princess Alice of Battenburg. On marriage HRH Princess Andrew of Greece and Denmark, Was born Deaf, She learnt to lip read four languages.
2 CONT
2 CONT = Royal House =
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.geni.com/projects/House-of-Battenberg '''House of Battenberg]''' (Cadet branch of the House of Hesse-Darmstadt)
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Alice_of_Battenberg '''Princess Alice of Battenberg'''] later Princess Andrew of Greece and Denmark (Victoria Alice Elizabeth Julia Marie; 25 February 1885 – 5 December 1969), was the mother 
2 CONC of Prince Philip, Duke of Edinburgh, and mother-in-law of Queen Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Princess Alice was the only royal to 
2 CONT * '''''give away her worldly goods,''''' 
2 CONT * '''''be buried in Jerusalem as "righteous among the nations"''' for saving Jews in World W''ar II, 
2 CONT * '''''start her own monastic order,''''' 
2 CONT * '''''devote her life to charity work,''''' 
2 CONT * '''''be profoundly deaf from birth''''' 
2 CONT * '''''speak three languages.'''''
