2 CONT
2 CONT '''Grand Duchess Anastasia Nikolaevna of Russia''' (Russian: Великая Княжна Анастасия Николаевна Романова, Velikaya Knyazhna Anastasiya Nikolayevna Romanova) born June 18 [O.S. June 5] 1901 died July 17, 1918
2 CONT
2 CONT Grand Duchess Anastasia was the youngest daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Nicholas-II-Alexandrovich-Romanov-Tsar-of-Russia/6000000000703639356?through=6000000006101264133 Tsar Nicholas II of Russia], the last sovereign of I
2 CONC mperial Russia, and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Alexandra-Romanov-Tsarina-of-Russia/6000000000703434259?through=6000000006101264133 Alexandra Fyodorovna].
2 CONT
2 CONT Died unmarried and without issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anastasia was a younger sister of Grand Duchess Olga, Grand Duchess Tatiana and Grand Duchess Maria, and was an elder sister of Alexei Nikolaevich, Tsarevich of Russia. She was murdered with her family on July 17, 1918 by forces o
2 CONC f the Bolshevik secret police.
