1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT Russian and German royalty. She was the daughter of heir to the Russian throne, Grand Duke Cyril Vladimirovich and Grand Duchess Victoria Feodorovna. In 1938, she married Prince Louis Ferdinand of Prussia, grandson of Kaiser Wilhe
2 CONC lm II. The couple was first married at the Russian Orthodox Church in Potsdam and later in a Lutheran ceremony at Doorn in the Netherlands in the presence of Kaiser Wilhelm II. She had four sons and three daughters. After World Wa
2 CONC r II, she lived in Bremen with her husband and died in 1967 of a heart attack while visiting her brother, Grand Duke Vladimir, at his home in France. She is buried next to her husband.
2 CONT
