1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Victor Alexander John Hope, 2nd Marquess of Linlithgow, KG, KT, GCSI, GCIE, OBE, TD, PC, FRSE (24 September 1887 – 5 January 1952) was a British Unionist politician, agriculturalist, and colonial administrator. He 
2 CONC served as Governor-General and Viceroy of India from 1936 to 1943. He was usually referred to simply as Linlithgow.
