1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''' John Scott, 4th Earl of Eldon''' 
2 CONT * Born on 29 March 1899.
2 CONT * Son of John Scott, Viscount Encombe and Hon. Mary Laura Fraser.
2 CONT * Married Hon. Magdalen Mary Charlotte Fraser, daughter of Simon Joseph Fraser, 14th Lord (Fraser of) Lovat and Hon. Laura Lister, on 10 April 1934.
2 CONT * Died on 20 October 1976 at age 77.
2 CONT * Educated at Ampleforth College, Ampleforth, Yorkshire, EnglandG.
2 CONT * Fought in the First World War.
2 CONT * Educated at Magdalen College, Oxford University, Oxford, Oxfordshire, England
2 CONT * Flight Lieutenant in the No. 930 (Hampshire) Squadron, Auxiliary Air Force.
2 CONT * Lieutenant in the Scots Greys (Special Reserve).
2 CONT * Succeeded as the 4th Baron Eldon, of Eldon, co. Durham [G.B., 1799] on 10 August 1926.
2 CONT * Succeeded as the 4th Viscount Encombe, of Encombe, co. Dorset [U.K., 1821] on 10 August 1926.
2 CONT * Succeeded as the 4th Earl of Eldon, co. Durham [U.K., 1821] on 10 August 1926.
2 CONT * Lord-in-Waiting to HM King George VI between 1937 and 1952.
2 CONT * Justice of the Peace (J.P.) for Hampshire in 1938.
2 CONT * Fought in the Second World War.
2 CONT * Appointed Knight Commander, Royal Victorian Order (K.C.V.O.) in 1952.
2 CONT * Lord-in-Waiting to HM Queen Elizabeth II between 1952 and 1968.
2 CONT * Deputy Lieutenant (D.L.) of Devon between 1957 and 1966.
2 CONT * Awarded the Grand Officier, Ordre national de la Légion d'honneur in 1960.
2 CONT * Appointed Knight Grand Cross, Royal Victorian Order (G.C.V.O.) in 1963.<br/>
2 CONT '''Children of John Scott, 4th Earl of Eldon and Hon. Magdalen Mary Charlotte Fraser'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * John Joseph Nicholas Scott, 5th Earl of Eldon b. 24 Apr 1937, d. 30 Jan 2017
2 CONT * Hon. Simon Peter Scott b. 13 Sep 1939, d. 30 May 2009
2 CONT * Hon. Un-named Scott b. 6 Sep 1955, d. 6 Sep 1955<br/>
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p4326.htm#i43253<br/>
2 CONT
