2 CONT
2 CONT Arden Edwin Allen was a son of Thomas Edwin Allen and Minnie Alvina Peterson.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hazel Hilton June 11, 1930 in the L.D.S. temple in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake County, Utah. They had two children, Joseph Hilton Allen and Margaret Ann Allen (Shaw).
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a long-time employee of the Delmonte Canning Company.
2 CONT
2 CONT The date of his burial is January 12, 1996.
