1 NAME Hans Georg Heinrich Ludwig Friedrich Hermann Ferdinand /von Carolath-Beuthen/
2 GIVN Hans Georg Heinrich Ludwig Friedrich Hermann Ferdinand
2 _MARNM von Carolath-Beuthen
2 NICK Jan Jerzy von Schoenaich-Carolath
1 NAME Hans Georg Prinz von Schönaich-Carolath
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 NOV 1907
2 ADDR
3 CITY Berlin
3 STAE Berlin
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 AUG 1943
2 ADDR
3 CITY Mants
3 STAE Kalmykia
3 CTRY Russia
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00110424&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Hans Georg, Prinz von Schönaich-Carolath, was born on 3 November 1907 in Berlin, the son of Johann Georg, Prinz von Schönaich-Carolath, and Hermine, Prinzessin Reuss zu Greiz. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 5 November 1922 in Doorn, in the Netherlands, his widowed mother married Wilhelm II, the ex-Emperor of Germany. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 20 june 1939 in Langseifersdorf, Hans Georg married Sibylle, Freiin von Zedlitz und Leipe, daughter of Günther, Freiherr von Zedlitz und Leipe, and Ilse von Lieres und Wilkau. They became the parents of a daughter and a son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 9 August 1943 in Mantschina, Russia, Hans Georg was killed in action. His widow died on 9 October 2006 in Vilsbiburg-Achldorf.
