1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Verners father has never been verified. His mother refused to reveal the identity of him, but we know for sure she worked at a place where the royal family resided parts of the summer. When she got pregnant she had
2 CONC  to leave her place there, and Verner were adopted by some others. After resigning her work she suddenly got money to buy a small shop. Where the money came from is not mentioned by her either.  When Verner got old and lived at a 
2 CONC home for elders, the staff there - unknowing his story - used to call him for "V-gurra", as he was a spitting image of the old King Gustaf V. Based on his history in relation to his obvious look as King Gustaf V, we in the family 
2 CONC consider him as a unconfirmed son of the king. :-)
