2 CONT
2 CONT Bernadotte has not been elected one of the Righteous Among the Nations by [http://www.yadvashem.org/ Yad Vashem], perhaps because one of the men who ordered his assassination was [http://www.geni.com/people/Yitzhak-Shamir-7th-Prim
2 CONC e-Minister-of-Israel-%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%97%D7%A7-%D7%A9%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%A8/6000000010580330351 Yitzhak Shamir], later Prime Minster of Israel. The murderer, [http://www.geni.com/people/Yehoshua-Cohen/6000000018307828682 Yehoshua Cohen
2 CONC ], was never brought to trial. 
