2 CONC n 3 June 1908 at Baden, Vienna, Austria.2 She died on 2 September 1956 at age 73 at Mariazell, Austria.2,3
2 CONT      She was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. She gained the title of Erzherzogin von Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduchess of Austria).1 She was given the name of Maria Henrietta Caroline Gabriele at birth.3 Children
