1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00084257&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Wilhelm, Prinz von Schönburg-Waldenburg, was born on 3 April 1913 in Guteborn, the son of Ulrich, Prinz von Schönburg-Waldenburg and Pauline, Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Freudenberg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 27 September 1939 in Rossla, Wilhelm married Marie Elisabeth, Prinzessin zu Stolberg-Rossla, daughter of Christoph Martin, 3.Fürst zu Stolberg-Rossla, and Ida, Prinzessin Reuss zu Greiz. They became the parents of two sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilhelm was killed in battle on 11 June 1944 near Parfouru, in Normandy. His widow died on 11 September 1975 in Ortenberg.
2 CONT
