1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Name/title: Christian Frederik Franz Michael Carl Valdemar Georg  zu Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Glücksburg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p10126.htm#i101253 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/W/per_page.php?id=6590 Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GScid=1960718&GRid=9422986& Find a Grave]
