2 CONT Grand Duke '''Dmitri Pavlovich Romanov''' of Russia (18 September 1891 – 5 March 1941)
2 CONT
2 CONT First son of Grand Duke Paul Alexandrovich and Greek Princess Grand Princess Alexandra Bonner, and grandson of Alexander II.  Known for being involved in the murder of the mystic peasant faith healer Grigori Rasputin, whom he felt
2 CONC  held undue sway over Tsar Nicholas II.
