2 CONT Princess Cecilie of Greece and Denmark (Greek: Πριγκίπισσα Σεσίλια της Ελλάδας και Δανίας) (22 June 1911 – 16 November 1937) was the wife of Hereditary Grand Duke George Donatus of Hesse and the sister of Prince Philip, Duke of Ed
2 CONC inburgh.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cecille, was heavily Pregnant, with her Fourth Child, when the accident occurred, which resulted in their deaths
