2 CONC a and Kseniya Aleksandrovna Romanov, Grand Duchess of Russia. He married Princess Nataliya Aleksandrovna Galitzine, daughter of Prince Aleksandr Vladimirovich Galitzine and Ljobow Glebova, on 31 July 1931 at New York City, New Yor
2 CONC k, U.S.A.G.2 He died on 23 June 1989 at age 81 at Woodside, California, U.S.A.   He gained the title of Prince Vassili of Russia.1
