2 CONT Max Prinz zu Schaumburg-Lippe1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #47938, b. 28 March 1898, d. 4 February 1974 Last Edited=10 Aug 2014 Consanguinity Index=4.2%
2 CONT      Max Prinz zu Schaumburg-Lippe was born on 28 March 1898 at Wels, Ober-Osterreich, AustriaG. He was the son of Albrecht Prinz zu Schaumburg-Lippe and Elsa Herzogin von Württemberg. He married Helga Claire Lee Roderbourg, daugh
2 CONC ter of Dr. Carl Hermann Roderbourg and Claude Lennox Miller, on 9 May 1933 at Bad Homburg von der Höhe, Germany. He died on 4 February 1974 at age 75 at Salzburg, AustriaG. Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S1454] Max-Mario Schaumburg-Lippe, "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family," e-mail message to Darryl Lundy, 10 September 2005. Hereinafter cited as "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sohn: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mario-Max Prinz zu Schaumburg-Lippe1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #167327, b. 1977 Last Edited=7 May 2011
2 CONT      Mario-Max Prinz zu Schaumburg-Lippe was born in 1977.2 He is the son of Dr. Helmut Wagner and Dr. Gertraud Thekla Antonia Schöppl.2
2 CONT      He was given the name of Mario-Helmut Wagner at birth.3 He was adopted by Helga Claire Lee Roderbourg.2 His name was legally changed to Mario Max Antonius Adolf Albert Eduard Oliver Gertraud Edith Helga Magdalena.1,3 Citation
2 CONC s
2 CONT
2 CONT [S1454] Max-Mario Schaumburg-Lippe, "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family," e-mail message to Darryl Lundy, 10 September 2005. Hereinafter cited as "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family." [S1547] Rupert Roth, "re: Mario-Max Prince Schaumburg-Lippe,
2 CONC " e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 8 December 2005. Hereinafter cited as "re: Mario-Max Prince Schaumburg-Lippe." [S1645] Alexander Fürst zu Schaumburg-Lippe, "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lund
2 CONC y, 21 March 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Schaumburg-Lippe Family."
