2 CONT
2 CONT Prussian Royalty. She was the Last Crown Princess of the German Empire. The daughter of Grand Duke Friedrich Franz III of Mecklenburg-Schwerin and his consort Grand Duchess Anastasia Mikhailovna of Russia, her father-in-law was Ka
2 CONC iser Wilhelm II, who abdicated as German Emperor on November 9, 1918. Crown Princess Cecilie married Crown Prince Friedrich Wilhelm of Prussia in a glittering ceremony on June 6, 1905. In 1945 she fled from her home in Potsdam's C
2 CONC astle Cecilienhof to the south of Germany to escape advancing Soviet troops. She died in Bad Kissingen and was buried next to her husband.
