1 NAME Hazel Adela /Skogrand/
2 GIVN Hazel Adela
2 SURN Skogrand
2 _MARNM Phillips
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 OCT 1916
2 ADDR
3 STAE Minnesota
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 DEC 2005
2 PLAC Brookside Manor
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Montevideo
3 STAE Minnesota
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hazel A. Phillips
2 CONT
2 CONT Oct. 13, 1916 - Dec. 30, 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT MONTEVIDEO -- Hazel Adela Phillips, 89, of Montevideo died Friday at Brookside Manor in Montevideo.
2 CONT
2 CONT The service will be at 1:30 p.m. Tuesday at Jevnaker Lutheran Church of rural Montevideo. Burial will be in Sunset Memorial Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Visitation will be this afternoon and evening, with the family present from 5 to 7 p.m. and a prayer service at 6:30 p.m., at the Anderson Funeral Home in Montevideo.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born Oct. 13, 1916, in Chippewa County to Anton and Helena (Svingen) Skogrand. She attended District 63 rural schools.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Clyde Phillips on Sept. 12, 1944, at Big Bend. They lived and farmed in Rosewood Township for four years and lived and farmed for 57 years in Mandt Township. They spent winters in Texas for 22 years. They moved to Broo
2 CONC kside Manor in Montevideo in September 2005.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a lifelong member of Jevnaker Lutheran Church, was active in Altar Guild and women's groups, and volunteered at Luther Haven Nursing Home. She was a member of Minnesota Valley Antique Farm Power and Machinery Association, 
2 CONC and had been a member of a homemakers group, a 4-H leader and a member of the Extension Service for a number of years.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by her husband; three daughters: Susan (and Doug) Swanson of West Des Moines, Iowa, Sally Phillips (and Jim Helling) of Plymouth, and Jane (and Mark) Laub of Oak Grove; three grandchildren and three great-grandchil
2 CONC dren.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by nine brothers and sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested Articles
2 CONT
2 CONT FUNERALS Dec 24th 2019 - 7am Funeral service listing published Dec. 24, 2019
2 CONT
2 CONT ACCIDENTS Dec 24th 2019 - 5am Records published Dec. 24, 2019
