1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Lord Patrick Crichton-Stuart
2 CONT * Born on 1 February 1913.
2 CONT * Son of John Crichton-Stuart, 4th Marquess of the County of Bute and Augusta Mary Monica Bellingham.
2 CONT * Married, '''firstly''', Jane von Bahr, daughter of Captain unknown von Bahr, on 14 October 1937.
2 CONT * Married, '''secondly''', Linda Irene Evans, daughter of William Evans, on 16 April 1947.
2 CONT * Died on 5 February 1956 at age 43. He gained the rank of Honorary Captain in the 11th Hussars.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Lord Patrick Crichton-Stuart and Jane von Bahr'''
2 CONT * Charles Patrick Colum Henry Crichton-Stuart b. 10 Mar 1939, d. 3 Jul 2001
2 CONT * Angela Mary Monica Crichton-Stuart b. 25 Mar 1940, d. 20 Mar 2015<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2395.htm#i23948
