1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''From [https://www.freebmd.org.uk/cgi/information.pl?cite=UtiOAjEB57Qh%2F9s5wT7Oqg&scan=1 FreeBMD: Registration of birth of Carola M. Noel in 1916]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT April to June 1916: Registration of birth of Carola M. Noel; Mother's maiden name: Douglas-dick; in St George Hanover Square, London (Volume 1a, Page 716)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.britishnewspaperarchive.co.uk/viewer/bl/0000577/19360323/002/0003 British Newspaper Archive: Aberdeen Press and Journal Monday, 23 March 1936 Page 3 Forthcoming Angus society wedding]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Forthcoming Angus society wedding. — The marriage arranged between Mr Thomas Steuart Fothringham, second son of Lieutenant Colonel W. Steuart Fothringham and the late Mrs Fothringham of Fothringham, Angus, and Carola Noel, the you
2 CONC ngest daughter of Major the Hon. Charles and Mrs Noel of Pitkerro, is to take place at [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brompton_Oratory Brompton Oratory, Brompton Road, Knightsbridge, London SW7 2RP 51.49722, -0.16972], on Tuesday,
2 CONC  21 April 1936. The young couple are known to many Aberdeenshire families.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.britishnewspaperarchive.co.uk/viewer/bl/0000563/19370810/060/0004 British Newspaper Archive: Dundee Evening Telegraph Tuesday, 10 August 1937 Page 4 Son for Mr and Mrs Thomas Steuart Fothringham]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Heir for Angus Laird''
2 CONT
2 CONT A son and heir has been born at [https://maps.nls.uk/geo/explore/#zoom=17.0&lat=51.28933&lon=-0.51652&layers=6&b=1&o=100&marker=51.289107,-0.518300 Boughton Hall, Send Marsh Road, Send, Surrey GU23 7DJ 51.289107, -0.518300], to th
2 CONC e wife of Mr Thomas Steuart Fothringham, of Pourie, Fothringham and Tealing, Angus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr Fothringham is the second son of the late Lieutenant-Colonel W. Steuart Fothringham, on whose death last year the family estates were divided between his three sons. Donald inherited Murthly and Strathbraan; Pourie, Fothringham
2 CONC , and Tealing came to Thomas; and Patrick, the youngest, was given Grandtully.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr T. S. Fothringham is an architect, and received his training in Dundee. Motor racing is his great hobby, and in 1934 he won third place in the R.A.C. Tourist Trophy race at Belfast.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Fothringham is also well known in Angus. She was formerly Miss Carola Noel, youngest daughter of Major the Hon. Charles and Mrs Noel of Pitkerro House, Dundee.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her marriage took place very quietly owing to the death of the bridegroom's father in April of last year at Pitkerro. She is 21, and was a debutante of the 1934 season.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.britishnewspaperarchive.co.uk/viewer/bl/0000564/19370925/119/0005 British Newspaper Archive: Dundee Courier Saturday, 25 September 1937 Page 5 Estate gifts for Fothringham heir]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The indoor and outdoor staffs of Fothringham and Tealing estates presented a silver porringer and spoon yesterday afternoon, Friday, 24 September 1937, to the infant heir, Robert Steuart Fothringham. The presentation was made by M
2 CONC r Joseph Sharpe, head gamekeeper, and the gift was accepted by Mr Steuart Fothringham. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Fothringham planted a tree on the lawn also to mark the birth of the heir.
2 CONT
2 CONT A bonfire was lit on Carrot Hill by Miss Marion Fothringham, and amongst those present were the laird and his wife, Messrs Donald and Patrick Fothringham, and estate employees and tenants.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-1258305842-1-3828/carola-mary-steuart-fothringham-born-noel-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage: Carola Mary Steuart Fothringham (born Noel) Family Trees]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * name: Carola Mary Steuart Fothringham (born Noel)
2 CONT * parents: Charles Hubert Francis Noel, 1885 - 1947, May Noel (born Dick), 1884 - 1964
2 CONT * born: Saturday, 3 June 1916
2 CONT * siblings: Jane Isabelle Mary Allgood (born Noel), 1912 - 1952, David Francis Douglas Noel, 1919 - 1974, Douglas Robert George Noel, 1924 - 2013, Archibald Charles William Noel, 1914 - 1997, Andrew Mungo James Noel, 1921 - 1972
2 CONT * marriage: to Thomas Steuart Fothringham on Tuesday, 21 April 1936
2 CONT * husband: Thomas Steuart Fothringham, 1907 - 1979
2 CONT * children: Robert Steuart Fothringham, 22nd of Pourie-Fothringham and 13th of Murthly, 1937 - 2012, <Private> Steuart Fothringham
2 CONT * died: Sunday, 12 March 1989
