1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==='''Princess Kira of Leiningen'''=== <br/>
2 CONT ''Kira Melita Feodora Marie Viktoria Alexandra Prinzessin zu Leiningen'' was born on 18 July 1930 at Coburg, Bayern, Germany. <br/>
2 CONT Kira was the daughter of Friedrich Karl Eduard Erwin HSH Karl 6th Prince of Leiningen and his wife HRH Mariya Kirillovna Romanov Grand Duchess of Russia. <br/>
2 CONT On 18 September 1963, Kira married Prince Andrej Karageorgievich of Yugoslavia, son of King Alexander I Karageorgievich of Yugoslavia and Marie von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen Princess of Romania, at Langten Green, Kent, England, in 
2 CONC a civil marriage. <br/>
2 CONT On 12 October 1963, Kira and Andrej were also married in a religious ceremony at Amorbach, Bayern, Germany.<br/>
2 CONT On 10 July 1972, Kira and Andrej Karageorgievich Prince of Yugoslavia were divorced at Frankfurt-am-Main, Hessen, Germany.<br/>
2 CONT Kira died on 24 September 2005 at age 75. <br/>
2 CONT Princess Kira and Prince Andrej Karageorgievich had three (3) children:<br/>
