2 CONT http://www.geni.com/path/M%C3%A5ns-Natt-och-Dag+is+related+to+Michael-Prinz-von-Preu%C3%9Fen?from=6000000003036073169&to=323461420160004237
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Having made the decision to contract a non-dynastic marriage, he submitted to his father (then head of the family) a renunciation on behalf of himself and his future descendants to the family's claim to the defunct thrones of Impe
2 CONC rial Germany and Royal Prussia, executed at Bremen on 29 August 1966.[1] On 23 September 1966, he married in Düsseldorf Roman Catholic commoner Jutta Jörn (born in Gießen, 27 January 1943), an administrative assistant.[2] The coup
2 CONC le had two daughters together prior to divorcing on 18 March 1982.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Princess Michaela Marie of Prussia (born 5 March 1967); married, on 14 February 2000, Jürgen Wessoly, with whom she has two children.
2 CONT     Princess Nataly Alexandra Caroline of Prussia (born 13 January 1970, Frankfurt am Main)
2 CONT
2 CONT On 23 June 1982, he married secondly in Bad Soden am Taunus, again non-dynastically, to Roman Catholic commoner Brigitte Dallwitz-Wegner (born in Kitzbühel, Austria, 17 September 1939 – 14 October 2016), granddaughter of German ae
2 CONC ronautical engineer Richard Wegner von Dallwitz (1873–1945),[3] also known as Richard von Dallwitz-Wegner.[4] The couple had no children.[1] 
