2 CONT '''Charles III''' (Charles Philip Arthur George; born 14 November 1948) is [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monarchy_of_the_United_Kingdom King of the United Kingdom] and 14 other [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commonwealth_realm Co
2 CONC mmonwealth realms]. He acceded to the throne on 8 September 2022 upon [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_and_state_funeral_of_Elizabeth_II the death of his mother], [https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-II-Queen-of-the-United-K
2 CONC ingdom/6000000003075071669 Elizabeth II]. Charles was coronated 6 May 2023. He was the longest-serving [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heir_apparent heir apparent] in British history and, at the age of 73, is the oldest person to a
2 CONC ssume the throne<br>
