2 TITL Prince Andrew, Duke of York
2 NOTE Prince Andrew, Duke of York (Andrew Albert Christian Edward; born 19 February 1960) is of the British Royal Family, the third child and second son of Queen Elizabeth II. He has held the title of Duke of York since 1986. The Duke o
3 CONC f York has been fourth in the line of succession since the birth of Prince Harry in 1984.
3 CONT
3 CONT Read more about Prince Andrew in his profile.
