2 CONT
2 CONT "David Albert Charles Armstrong-Jones, 2nd Earl of Snowdon (born 3 November 1961), styled as Viscount Linley until 2017 and known professionally as David Linley, is an English furniture maker and chairman of the auction house Chri
2 CONC stie's UK. The son of Princess Margaret, Countess of Snowdon and of Antony Armstrong-Jones, 1st Earl of Snowdon, he is a grandson of King George VI and is 18th in line to succeed his maternal aunt Queen Elizabeth II."
2 CONT
