1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "The Lady Sarah Frances Elizabeth Chatto, née Armstrong-Jones (b. 1 May 1964), is the only daughter of the 1st Earl of Snowdon and Princess Margaret, Countess of Snowdon, the second daughter of King George VI and Q
2 CONC ueen Elizabeth. She is 18th in line of succession to the thrones of each of the Commonwealth realms; at the time of her birth, she was seventh in line. She is the only niece of Queen Elizabeth II and the youngest grandchild of Kin
2 CONC g George VI and Queen Elizabeth."
