2 CONT Lady Gabriella Windsor is a British writer and contributing editor. She is the daughter of Prince and Princess Michael of Kent, and a cousin of King Charles. She was born on April 23, 1981 in London and studied at Brown University
2 CONC  in the US, where she met her husband. She is also a singer-songwriter and released two songs in 2020 for charity. She is 56th in the line of succession to the British throne. 
