1 CONT deeply influenced him. His reign saw a revolutionary change in the importance
1 CONT and prestigue of Prussia, which was to have profound implications for much of
1 CONT the subsequent history of Europe. He established in the minds of educated
1 CONT Europeans a notion of what "enlightened depotism" should be.
