0 @N6000000005598924205@ NOTE On 13 July 1818>, he married Princess Adelaide of_Saxe-Meiningen, daughter of the Duke of Saxe-Meiningen , a woman half his age. Though he had been able to father at least ten illegitimate children by Mrs Jordan, Clarence had only
