1 CONT       In 1811 Duke Ludwig, the eldest brother of King Friedrich I of Wuerttemberg, moved to the castle in Kirchheim together with his family. After his death in 1817 his widow Henriette continued to live there for 40 years and due
1 CONC  to her social and cultural engagement she was and is still a popular person in Kirchheim.
