1 CONT
1 CONT      King of Wends and the Goths, Duke of Schleswig, Count of Holstein, Storman, Ditmarschen, Lauenborg and Oldenburg, born a prince of the Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Glücksburg line, a junior branch of the family which had rul
1 CONC ed Denmark for centuries, was chosen to be king after the extinction of the most senior line, and he assumed the throne upon the death of King Frederik VII.  Rather an inept ruler.  He lost the Duchies of Schleswig and Holstein to
1 CONC  Prussia.  His reign as King began in 1863.
