0 @N6000000002322332123@ NOTE The 3rd son of Victoria, he was a Prince and a soldier; created the Duke of
1 CONT Connaught and Strathearn in 1874.
0 @N6000000002176675853@ NOTE The 3rd son of Victoria, he was a Prince and a soldier; created the Duke of
1 CONT Connaught and Strathearn in 1874.
