0 @N6000000002188395638@ NOTE Her baptismal name was Beatrice Mary Victoria Feodore.Extrovert and boisterous child until Prince Albert's death, after which her mother's grief and reliance on her turned her into a shy, withdrawn and awkward girl.  Her sons, Leo
1 CONC pold and Maurice were both hemophiliacs and her daughter Ena was also a carrier of the gene.  Plagued by Rheumatism.
