0 @N6000000002176677278@ NOTE His father only reigned for 3 months, and he succeeded him to power. At the
1 CONT end of WW I, on November 10, a day before the Armistice was signed, he fled
1 CONT Germany and went to Holland to spend his remaining years in seclusion at
1 CONT Doorn Castle in the Netherlands. He remarried when his first wife died in
1 CONT 1921. Later, when he died on June 4, 1941, he was buried with full military
1 CONT honors ordered by Hitler. Note: "Kaiser" means German emperor. Thus ends the
1 CONT Prussian/German monarchs, followed by the Weimar Republic & The Third Reich.
0 @N6000000002240820576@ NOTE His father only reigned for 3 months, and he succeeded him to power. At the
