0 @N6000000002322342677@ NOTE Historical facts during this time: In 1914, World War I in Europe between
1 CONT France, Russia, Britain against Germany. Also, the Panama canal is opened
1 CONT linking the Atlantic and Pacific Oceans. In 1915, Albert Einstein formulates
1 CONT his Theory of Relativity. In 1916, Margaret Sanger is arrested for opening a
1 CONT birth-control clinic in Brooklyn, New York. In 1917, the U.S. enters the war
1 CONT in Europe, & the earliest jazz recording is made. In 1918, Air mail service
1 CONT starts and an influenza pandemic begins, killing 21-22 million in 2 years.
