0 @N6000000005599217491@ NOTE She was the brightest of her siblings.
1 CONT
1 CONT She died suddenly and unexpectedly in the garden of Harewood House.
0 @N6000000007329600845@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Christened: Victoria Alexandra Alice Mary,  but always known by her last name,
1 CONT Mary.  Mary was to prove the brightest of the family.  Her eldest brother once
1 CONT said that it was a pity she would not succeed, for "she was much cleverer than
1 CONT me".  In 1932 she was declared Princess Royal.  The Princess Royal died
1 CONT suddenly and unexpectedly in the garden of Harewood House,  Yorkshire. aka:
1 CONT Mary, Princess Royal and Countess of Harewood.
