0 @N6000000002322332587@ NOTE She was a plain, unimaginative person with few intellectual interests and no
1 CONT talents, who bored her husband and encouraged his reactionary tendencies but
1 CONT all the same represented a point of stability in his life with six sons and a
1 CONT daughter. He was born with a damaged left arm; the limb never grew to
1 CONT full size, and some historians have found a clue to his behaviour in this
1 CONT disability. His father's lack of stamina to dominate was certainly not shared
1 CONT by his mother, as her intellect was hopelessly at the mercy of her feelings.
