0 @N6000000002322332482@ NOTE He was the eldest son of Emperor Alexander III. Forced to abdicate in March
1 CONT 1917, he and his entire family were held prisoner by the Bolsheviks and
1 CONT executed at Ekaterinburg on July 16/17, 1918. Thus ended the last bloodline of
1 CONT Czars or Russian Emperors dating back to 1543. Communism would spread
1 CONT throughout an empire known as the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics. That
1 CONT empire would crumble with the felling of the "Berlin Wall" in 1989, because a
1 CONT bankrupt Societ Union (USSR) simply ran out of money. A new Russia emerged.
