1 CONT computer is accepted by the U.S. Census Bureau. In 1952, British de Havilland
1 CONT Comet becomes 1st jet airliner to enter service, and the 1st automatic
1 CONT pinsetter is installed in a bowling alley in Brooklyn, NY.. In mid-1953,
1 CONT Armistice ends the Korean War.
