1 CONT    1. ^ As a titled royal, Philip holds no surname, but, when one is used, it is the surname he assumed when he became a British citizen, Mountbatten
1 CONT    2. ^ He was born 10 June 1921 according to the Gregorian Calendar. However, at that time, Greece was still using the Julian Calendar; it did not convert to the Gregorian until 1 March 1923. His birth certificate shows the Julia
1 CONC n date of 28 May 1921. (Charles Higham and Roy Moseley (1991), Elizabeth and Philip: The Untold Story, p.73.)
1 CONT    3. ^ "Prince Philip's racist quotes compiled in a book", Associated Press, 2006-05-31. Retrieved on 2008-01-23. 
