1 CONC e, masoned argent, windows, port, turret caps and vanes gules. Crest: A plume of five ostrich feathers alternately sable and argent issuant from a ducal coronet or. Supporters: Dexter, a representation of Heracles girt about the l
1 CONC oins with a lion skin, crowned with a chaplet of oak leaves and holding in the dexter hand a club proper; sinister, a lion, queue fourchée, ducally crowned or and gorged with a naval coronet azure. Coronet: A coronet composed of c
1 CONC rosses-patées and fleurs-de-lys alternately or. Motto: God is my help. Creations: B., E. and D. (UK) 19 Nov 1947.
