1 CONT separating east and west Berlin, as the "cold war" continues between the U.S.
1 CONT and Communist U.S.S.R., starting just after WW II, into 1989. In 1962, the
1 CONT U.S. Supreme Court rules that school prayers are a violation of the 1st
1 CONT Amendment. In 1963, John Kennedy is assassinated by Lee Harvey Oswald.
