1 CONT Full name
1 CONT Anne Elizabeth Alice Louise[1]
1 CONT Detail
1 CONT Titles and styles
1 CONT HRH The Princess Royal
1 CONT HRH The Princess Anne
1 CONT HRH Princess Anne of Edinburgh
1 CONT Royal house House of Windsor
1 CONT Father Philip, Duke of Edinburgh
1 CONT Mother Elizabeth II
1 CONT Born 15 August 1950 (1950-08-15) (age 57)
1 CONT Clarence House, London
1 CONT Baptised 21 October 1950
1 CONT Buckingham Palace, London
1 CONT
1 CONT The Princess Anne, Princess Royal (Anne Elizabeth Alice Louise; born 15 August 1950), is a member of the British Royal Family and the only daughter of Elizabeth II. She is the seventh holder of the title Princess Royal, and is cur
1 CONC rently tenth in the line of succession to the British Throne. At the time of her birth, she was third in line, but moved to second place from when her mother became Queen, until the birth of her brother, The Prince Andrew, in 1960
1 CONC .
1 CONT
1 CONT The Princess Royal is known for her charitable work, and is the only member of the British Royal Family to have competed in the Olympic Games.
1 CONT Contents
1 CONT [hide]
