1 CONT     * Colonel-in-Chief, of Flag of Canada the 8th Canadian Hussars (Princess Louise's)
1 CONT     * Colonel-in-Chief, of Flag of Canada the Communications and Electronics Branch
1 CONT     * Colonel-in-Chief, of Flag of Canada the Canadian Forces Medical Service[15]
